   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence 14 to resolve the story and connect back to the reason the narrator made the game?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Coding is a useful skill that many people use every day at their jobs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"generic-fact-ending"},{"text":"The next day, Amina played the game nine times in a row, giggling at every banana.","is_correct":true},{"text":"I coded a monkey game for my sister because she loves jungle animals.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-situation"},{"text":"Then I closed the laptop, brushed my teeth, and went straight to sleep.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"flat-ending-no-reflection"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The next day, Amina played the game nine times in a row, giggling at every banana.$q$, $q$The correct choice shows the gift reaching Amina, which resolves the birthday plan from sentence 1. The choice about why the narrator coded the game only restates the beginning and does not resolve anything.$q$, 'draft', 'abfeb509-6855-58a7-b951-aa4c79fa3520')
